  /// job is waiting for compute capacity or compute resource provision.
  /// Downloading - An optional stage for algorithms that support File
  /// training input mode. It indicates that data is being downloaded to the
  /// ML storage volumes. Training - Training is in progress. Interrupted -
  /// The job stopped because the managed spot training instances were
